Error: Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch: Text isn't joined with `+`
  --> http_route_written_parts.jet:30:16
    |
 30 |     router.get("/h/" + id, handle)
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: There's one way to build text: interpolation (S8)
 Fix: Write the pieces inside one string: "/h/{id}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch

